  "body": "In the spec on the sync API https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#id251 on presence updates, the following is specified:\r\n\r\n\"The updates to the presence status of **other users**.\" (Emphasis mine)\r\n\r\nThis would appear to suggest that the user's own presence is excluded, which at least to me appears to contradict https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#events-on-change-of-profile-information \r\n\r\nPerhaps this could use different wording to make the intent more clear?",
